[statement]
Requirements are collected before a provided name is decided too: `a`
requires `v`, `b` requires `v<2`, and `p1`, providing `v` at 1, is installed
rather than `p2` at 2.

[repository]
P:app
V:1
D:a b

P:a
V:1
D:v

P:b
V:1
D:v<2

P:p1
V:1
p:v=1

P:p2
V:1
p:v=2

[request]
app

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install p1 1
install a 1
install b 1
install app 1
